    cml:logicSummary "Spreading the authorisation" ;
    cml:premiseText "(2) A person identified in an authority as being authorised to engage in controlled conduct for the purposes of the controlled operation is authorised to do so for the period of effect of the authority..." ;
    cml:conclusionText "...unless: (a) the authority specifies a shorter period during which the person is so authorised; or (b) the authority is varied to provide that the person is no longer so authorised; or (c) the authority is cancelled before the end of that period." ;
