    cml:operator "⊕" ;
    cml:logicSummary "The person's parole order or licence revocation and the person becoming liable to serve are related by diffusion" ;
    cml:premiseText "(4) If the parole order or licence relating to a person is taken to have been revoked under subsection (1) or (2)," ;
